  📗 *data* as text, or no value when it is not well-formed UTF-8. 📗
  🐇❗️ 🔡 data 📇 ➡️ 🍬🔡 🍇
    ↩️ 🔡🐇🧮 data❗️
  🍉

  📗
    Percent-decodes *text*. Gives no value when an escape is not % followed by
    two hex digits, when a decoded byte is zero, or when the result is not
    well-formed UTF-8. A plus sign is left alone.
  📗
  🐇❗️ 🧹 text 🔡 ➡️ 🍬🔡 🍇
    ↩️ 🧼🐇🧰 text 👎❗️
  🍉

  📗 The same as 🧹, with + decoded as a space, as in query strings and forms. 📗
  🐇❗️ 🧺 text 🔡 ➡️ 🍬🔡 🍇
    ↩️ 🧼🐇🧰 text 👍❗️
  🍉

